@startuml
title Step Execution Sequence - Step execute() to Stage
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Stage" as Stage
participant "Step Composition" as SC
participant "Step[TInput,TOutput]" as Step
participant "StepExecutionResult[TOutput]" as SRes
participant "OptionalResultContributions" as ORC

Stage -> SC : invoke Step via public callable
SC -> Step : execute(input: TInput)
Step -> SC : assemble result
(processingArtifact + optional validatorResult/errorResult/errorHandlerResult)
SC -> ORC : group optional contributions
(validatorResult, errorResult, errorHandlerResult)
SC --> SRes : StepExecutionResult[TOutput]
SRes --> Stage : return structured aggregate result

note right of SC : Step owns internal composition
Stage does NOT invoke SPUs/supporting units directly
StepExecutionResult independent of Step Aggregate
OptionalResultSlot: Absent != Present(None)

@enduml